/* The viewBox is fixed, so reading size falls with the drawn width. The steps
   were measured in CSS pixels at the widths this cover gets — 750 on a post at
   1440, 300 on a post at 390, 316 as a blog tile on a phone and 224 as a blog
   tile on a desktop. Below 400 every word in the finished picture is at 7.3 px
   or more at the smallest tile and near 10 px on a phone. Only the chips still
   in flight carry a smaller word (5.6 px there), for a moment, before it lands
   as a row at 7.7 px. The quote's status and the sleeper's z step out rather
   than print at 4 px, and the tick and the sun dot say the same thing without
   them. Strokes thicken with the step so the
